      "content": "it’s not that simple tho. there aren't any \"small steps\" that actually work here. everything is so controlled. it feels like the walls are just getting closer every day and i dont think there is any way to actually change my life without destroying everything first. it feels like the only way to really be free is to just... not be part of this anymore.",
